Wakaba Mutsumi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wang","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wanqing","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{"Self-Sustain":{"entries":[{"name":"Blemishine","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Entelechia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Executor the Ex Foedere","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Hoshiguma the Breacher","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"totalCount":96}},"forms":null,"skillRanges":{"2":{"skillName":"Healing Wings","baseRangeId":"1-1","baseRange":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]},"levelRangeIds":["x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4","x-4"],"grids":{"x-4":{"cols":3,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,2],"rangeCells":[[3,1],[3,2],[3,3],[2,1],[2,3],[1,1],[1,2],[1,3]]}},"changesAt":[]}},"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Hey, Doctor. I'm here to hang!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Doctor, don't look down on me just 'cause I'm little. Back where I'm from, all the kids looked up to me.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"Durin used the name of our race as her codename because she's so lazy, but isn't it kind of dumb how calling me 'Myrtle of Durin' made me sound like I belong to her or something?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"I understand how all the machines here work, but it still feels weird using them. Some have a lot of different parts, but some are surprisingly simple.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"My banner? Good eye, Doctor. It sure is a tablecloth from my house. I sneaked it out with me because it can't get dirty. My dad is probably pretty mad about it!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"Is my apple really that great? They're popular back home. You can study or play with it if you want, Doctor, just don't break it.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"There are still many things I'm not used to on land, but I love the many delicious foods. The cafe on Rhodes Island is my favorite!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"I do have to point out the fact, Doctor, that I am a full-grown adult! And I'm tall by Durin standards! Please tell everyone to stop patting me on the head and giving me candy!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Say, Doctor, are you interested in my homeland? I can take you there! But it's pretty far, so wait till I'm in the mood.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Are you taking a break? You can use my banner as a blanket.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Reporting in! You must be the Doctor? Call me Myrtle, Myrtle of Durin. Durin said I could get a job here, so what have you got for me? I may be small, but I'm tough!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Cool fight... Got some more, Doctor?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Oh, did I get promoted? Does that mean I can go somewhere I couldn't before?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"I told you I'm tough! Told you!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"There's a mission? I wanna go!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Don't anyone wander away.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Let's go!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Don't worry, you got me!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Hmm?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Whoa, almost dozed off...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Good scenery here, Doctor!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"I'm here to help!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"I have to get serious now!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Gather around me, guys!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"We're counting on you again today, little apple.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Phew, I'm exhausted! I wanna go to lie down, Doctor.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"Flawless victory! I was pretty good, wasn't I, Doctor?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"We won, Doctor, and that's what counts!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Run!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Wow, Rhodes Island is huge!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Hey, that is fun!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Why can't the cafe open 24 hours?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Take the flag down, tie it up over here... Good! That's my cloth sack done! Oh, Doctor, you're here, too. Come, we'll eat up all the tasty food in the canteen! It's the first day of the year. Let's kick it off by eating our fill!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Any more fun things to do, Doctor?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"So, Doctor, today's your birthday, huh? Then as a mature adult, let me give you a little present. Hm, Doctor, kneel down a little... Ahem-hem. Good job, good job... Alright! That was a compliment from the Generalissimo herself. You did well, Doctor.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"I guess I followed Durin to a pretty nice place. I've seen huge nomadic cities, beaten up so many baddies in battle, and eaten so many great foods I'd never seen before. Once I get home, I'll turn all these stories into a travelogue and get it published. It's bound to be a bestseller!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Hollie Taylor"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_151_myrtle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Shino Shimoji"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_151_myrtle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Cool"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_151_myrtle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Chung Yu-joung"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_151_myrtle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}